# legacy-site

The site that ran at **aryankochhar.in** before the 2026 redesign, kept so the
old version does not only exist on a Desktop and in a zip.

It is a single self-extracting HTML bundle produced by a design-canvas tool:
one ~986 KB file with every asset inlined and a small unpacker script that
rebuilds the page at runtime. There is no build, no source tree and no
dependency list — this file *is* the site.

| File | Source | Bytes |
|---|---|---|
| `index.html` | fetched from the live `https://aryankochhar.in` | 986,611 |
| `index.desktop-copy.html` | `Desktop/aryan-website/index.html` | 986,256 |

The two differ by 355 bytes, so they are separate builds. The live copy is the
one that was actually being served, and is the authoritative archive; the
desktop copy is kept because it is what existed locally and the difference was
never explained.

This is an orphan branch — it shares no history with `main` deliberately, so
the old bundle never mixes into the new source tree.

To view it: check out this branch and open `index.html` in a browser. It needs
JavaScript, since the page unpacks itself on load.
